<Base title="About Sekiya" description="An independent institute for empirical agent-behavior research and technology.">
  <header class="page-head shell"><p class="kicker">About Sekiya</p><h1>Ambitious questions. Restrained claims.</h1><p class="page-sub">Sekiya is an independent institute for empirical research on autonomous-agent behavior and for technology that helps understand difficult systems.</p></header>
  <section class="section shell"><div class="institute-grid"><div><h3>Research</h3><p>Behavior is measured under stated conditions. Observations are not silently promoted into claims about cognition, motive or intent.</p></div><div><h3>Technology</h3><p>Technology builds useful, reliable instruments and products. It can inform Research without owning its conclusions.</p></div><div><h3>Public benefit</h3><p>Useful public explanation and honest publication are institute-level outputs, not a content programme or a promise to publish unfinished work.</p></div><div><h3>Boundaries</h3><p>The Research Record is preserved as history. Personal Computational Studies, Ghalvera, Lathilda, Mundias and Raypane are not Sekiya work.</p></div></div></section>
</Base>
